			subtitle: "In the depths of a murky river, your reflection flickers on the water’s surface before vanishing into the shadows below. There’s something lurking there—a presence you can’t quite see, but feel. As you wade into the water, a sudden flash of light pierces the gloom, and a Drowned lunges at you, wielding a Trident with deadly precision. The weapon it holds is ancient, forged by unknown hands and imbued with the power of the seas. Only those brave enough to face these drowned warriors can hope to claim it. The battle is fierce, but in the end, the Trident is yours—a relic of forgotten depths. Its weight feels perfect in your hands, as if it was meant for you."
